    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d292-a1">

                <pb facs="0582" n="476" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg476"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Extract from the London Gazette of Tuesday,
                        November</hi> 4, 1890.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Foreign Office</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-11-04"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 4,
                        1890</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>It is hereby notified, for public information, that in pursuance of an agreement
                    with the Sultan of Zanzibar, the dominions of his highness are placed under the
                    protectorate of Her Britannic Majesty.</p>
                <p>The protectorate comprises the territory recognized as belonging to his highness
                    in the articles of agreement between Great, Britain and Germany, recorded in the
                    note from his excellency Count Hatzfeldt of the 29th October, 1886, and in the
                    note from the Earl of Iddesleigh of the 1st November following, with the
                    exception of the territory lying to the south of the river Umba on the island of
                    Mafia, and of the districts of Brava, Merka, Magadisho, and Warksheikh.</p>
                <pb facs="0583" n="[Map 2]" xml:id="pg-seq-0583-map-2"/>
